  "_note": "S2 s.156(2)(a): \"Where the total income of a resident individual assessee for any tax year is chargeable to tax under section 202(1) … (a) the income does not exceed twelve lakh rupees, 100% of the income-tax payable or ₹ 60000, whichever is less\". Limited by s.156(3): \"shall not exceed income-tax payable as per the rates provided in section 202(1)\". Not amended by FA 2026. 1961 counterpart: s.87A first proviso (a), as amended by FA 2025 s.20. TY 2025-26 version arrives with W-052c.",
